      "text": "%spark\n// Maps also may be either\n\nval m1 = mutable.Map('a' -> 1, 'b' -> 2, 'c' -> 3)\n\nvar m2 = immutable.Map('d' -> 4, 'e' -> 5, 'f' -> 6)\nval m3 = immutable.Map('d' -> 4, 'e' -> 5, 'f' -> 6)\n\nshow(m1.hashCode(),\nm2.hashCode()\n)\n",
