      "text": "%spark\n// Sets may be either:\n\nimport scala.collection._\n\nval s1 = mutable.Set(1,2,3)\nvar s2 = immutable.Set(1,2,3)\n\n// += on both types:\n\ns1 += 4  // calls += on mutable.Set\ns1\n\ns2 += 4  // turns into s2 = s2 + 4\ns2",
