    {
      "text": "%spark\ndef squareRootOfAll(xs: Seq[Int]): Seq[Double] =\n  xs.map(x => math.sqrt(x))\n\nsquareRootOfAll(v)\nsquareRootOfAll(listc)\nsquareRootOfAll(array2)\n\n\nval set1 = Set(1,2,3,1,2,4,5)\n\n",
      "config": {
